{"step_index":301,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T15:09:13Z","thinking":"Initial observation: the `secret-tool` lookup provided a key, which appears to be the Brave Safe Storage key. Investigating how this key is decrypted within Chromium on Linux, specifically focusing on Chromium's `os_crypt_linux.cc` file. It appears the password used is the secret storage key itself, potentially base64 decoded. The decryption method employs PBKDF2 HMAC-SHA1 with the \"saltysalt\" salt and one iteration for v11, generating a 16-byte key for AES encryption.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"python3 -c '\\nimport sqlite3, shutil, os, subprocess, hashlib\\n\\ndb_path = \\\"/home/koby/.config/BraveSoftware/Brave-Browser/Default/Cookies\\\"\\nshutil.copy2(db_path, \\\"/tmp/cookies_copy.sqlite\\\")\\nconn = sqlite3.connect(\\\"/tmp/cookies_copy.sqlite\\\")\\nc = conn.cursor()\\nc.execute(\\\"SELECT name, encrypted_value FROM cookies WHERE host_key LIKE \\\\\\\"%wikitech%\\\\\\\"\\\")\\nrows = c.fetchall()\\n\\n# secret from secret-tool\\nraw_secret = b\\\"0CTszqEBLTeBkklU8g4lcg==\\\"\\n# Chromium Linux PBKDF2: password = raw_secret, salt = b\\\"saltysalt\\\", iterations = 1, keylen = 16\\nkey = hashlib.pbkdf2_hmac(\\\"sha1\\\", raw_secret, b\\\"saltysalt\\\", 1, 16)\\nprint(\\\"Derived key hex:\\\", key.hex())\\n\\nfor name, enc in rows:\\n    # v10 or v11\\n    prefix = enc[:3]\\n    ciphertext = enc[3:]\\n    # IV is 16 bytes of spaces: b\\\" \\\" * 16\\n    iv = b\\\" \\\" * 16\\n    \\n    # decrypt with openssl\\n    proc = subprocess.Popen(\\n        [\\\"openssl\\\", \\\"enc\\\", \\\"-d\\\", \\\"-aes-128-cbc\\\", \\\"-K\\\", key.hex(), \\\"-iv\\\", iv.hex(), \\\"-nopad\\\"],\\n        stdin=subprocess.PIPE, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE\\n    )\\n    out, err = proc.communicate(ciphertext)\\n    # Strip PKCS7 padding\\n    print(name, \\\"->\\\", out[:50])\\n\\nconn.close()\\nos.remove(\\\"/tmp/cookies_copy.sqlite\\\")\\n'\"","Cwd":"\"/home/koby\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"5000","toolAction":"\"Decrypting wikitech cookies\"","toolSummary":"\"Decrypt wikitech cookies using derived key\""}}]}
