{"step_index":351,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-23T08:17:31Z","content":"**Yes!** The document strictly follows the official **`[Template] LLD`** from the **Projets** collection:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Template Structure Adherence\n\nThe document was structured following the corporate template sections:\n\n| Template Section | Content Implemented in Document |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **`## Description`** | Answers the template prompts (*Raison d'être, améliorations, problèmes résolus*), detailing the regional Qmail-LDAP context (MTQ, GUA, GUY, and upstream `172.30.37.225`), consolidation on `mtq-mailsrvp-01`, and the software stack (Postfix, Dovecot, Roundcube, LDAP, MariaDB/ProxySQL, PMG). |\n| **`## Schéma n1 (physique)`** | Documented as **N/A** per template guidelines, as the target infrastructure is 100% virtualized on VMware vSphere. |\n| **`## Schéma n3 (paquet)`** | Logical addressing and network zones diagram (WAN, DMZ `trp-wextp-fe1`, mail server `mtq-mailsrvp-01`, PMG filter, and backend LDAP/DB). |\n| **`## Schéma n4 (transport)`** | End-to-end transport connectivity sequence diagram (HTTPS, Submission 587, IMAP 143/993, LMTP 24, LDAP 389, SQL 3306). |\n| **`## Schéma fonctionnel`** | Functional architecture diagram linking Webmail/clients, Postfix (MTA), Dovecot (MDA), Maildir storage, LDAP passdb/userdb, and ProxySQL/MariaDB. |\n| **`## Matrice de Câblage`** | Standard template table preserved and marked as virtualized. |\n| **`## Matrice de Flux`** | Standard template table filled with all inter-server network flows from the MediaWiki source. |\n| **`## Annexes`** | Complementary operational constraints (mail attribute corruption, legacy sentmail formats, Maildir conventions, and link to the Infra migration page). |\n\n---\n\n### 2. Outline Template Association\n\nThe document is also officially linked to the template in Outline's metadata:\n\n* **Linked Template**: **`[Template] LLD`** (`ca2700fd-8b55-4348-936